WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.050
Here I go, Jack Atlas!

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:10.310
Level 4 Guldfaxe tunes Level 3 
Tanngrisnir and Level 3 Tanngnjostr!

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:16.790
When the gate to the star world opens, the 
ancient god of battle swings its magical hammer.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.260
As the earth trembles, it 
arrives with roaring thunder!

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:23.390
Synchro Summon!

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:27.830
Come, Thor, Lord of the Aesir!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.390
Thor, Lord of the Aesir has arrived.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:53.310
The moment I activated the trap card 
Brisingamen, I knew this would happen.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:55.370
You'll find out the power of a god!

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:59.760
Thor, Lord of the Aesir 
attacks Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.810
Thunder Pyle!

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.800
Whoa!

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:24.170
He annihilated Jack Atlas's ace monster 
Red Dragon Archfiend in a single strike!

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.080
This is the power of a god!

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:30.620
I promise to get back the pride that I lost!

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:33.850
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:39.280
That impact felt like it 
would tear my body apart!

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:42.590
This is what it's like to fight a god?

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:51.050
But I won't lose, even 
if my opponent is a god!

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:53.290
My turn!

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:57.560
How will he fight against a god?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.200
Let's watch carefully.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:05.080
I summon the Tuner Monster Barrier 
Resonator in defense position!

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.540
Then I switch Top Runner to defense position.

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:13.830
I set one card and end my turn!

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:18.860
With two defending monsters, 
he's strengthening his defense.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.340
That's pointless.

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.680
No defense works against a god!

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.150
My turn!

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:29.690
I activate Thor, Lord of the Aesir's effect!

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:36.250
I use Top Runner's effect to increase Thor, 
Lord of the Aesir's attack points by 600!

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.700
It powered up again!

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:45.640
It uses the opponent monster's 
effect to power up.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.300
This is the power of a god.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:52.490
I activate the trap Nordic Relic Mjollnir!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:57.700
My god can battle twice this turn, 
and it deals 1000 points of damage

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:01.490
for every monster that it destroys in battle!

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:20.240
Thor, Lord of the Aesir 
attacks Barrier Resonator!

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:23.560
Thunder Pyle!

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:35.200
Riding Duels.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:38.400
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:45.230
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:06.520
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:16.630
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:22.870
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:28.810
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:34.590
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:40.190
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:46.560
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:52.340
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:58.680
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:04.950
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:34.780
Battle of Souls!Thor, Lord of 
the Aesir vs Red Nova Dragon

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:41.760
Whoa!  God's power caused Jack 
Atlas to lose his balance!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:43.420
What was that impact?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.060
Jack!

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:50.530
Thank goodness!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.060
Did you see that, Yusei?

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.410
Yeah.  Jack took real damage.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.100
Real damage?

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:04.360
Unbelievable!  God's power has become real?

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.580
No way.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.050
Unbelievable.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.210
What's going on?

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.340
Yusei...

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:14.010
Team Ragnarok, who are you?

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:21.360
I knew something would happen in the battle 
between the Crimson Dragon and the Rune Eyes...

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.320
...but I never thought a god 
would give this much power.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:27.490
This duel won't end safely.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:31.200
Thor, Lord of the Aesir attacks Top Runner!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.460
Thunder Pyle!

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:46.700
Jack!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.150
Master Atlas!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:53.630
Did that hurt?  The impact 
swallowed up Jack Atlas!

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:57.840
What's going on?  Jack isn't coming out!

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:59.200
Jack!

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.240
Yusei!

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:03.940
Did Jack Atlas crash?

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.530
Crash?

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:09.590
Jack lost...

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.330
No way...

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.560
I can't stay here!

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:19.330
If I don't run away, Jack 
will be angry at me instead!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:25.030
Even Jack Atlas couldn't 
survive the power of a god.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:29.800
Jack!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:34.090
Jack has emerged!  He didn't crash!

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:38.590
That impact was too weak 
to make Jack Atlas crash!

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.300
I'm saved.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:51.120
It's getting exciting.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:54.230
I wonder who's going to win?

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.150
Stop making us worry.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.820
That wasn't enough to make Jack crash!

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:04.560
Yeah!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.070
He's doing well.

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.710
He's very tenacious.

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:14.160
He can't afford to lose this duel either.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:18.810
Jack Atlas, that's why you're 
an opponent worth defeating!

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:21.400
I won't let you escape by crashing!

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.560
I'll defeat you by dueling!

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:27.790
I'll send those words right back at you!

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:30.750
You'll discover Jack Atlas's power!

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:34.060
I activate the trap card Tuner's Reflect.

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:38.580
When two or more of my Tuner 
Monsters are destroyed this turn,

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.570
I can Special Summon 
those two Tuner Monsters.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:47.920
Then you take damage equal to the Special 
Summoned monsters' attack points!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.140
Jack Atlas won't lose against you!

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:02.980
All right!  He dealt 1400 points of damage!

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:06.070
But he only has 900 life points left.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:10.100
900 points is the same 
as nothing against a god.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:13.920
And the god still has an effect 
that it hasn't activated.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:22.880
Since he has two Tuner Monsters, he's 
planning to summon a new Synchro Monster.

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:28.540
But no matter what Synchro Monster you 
summon, it'll be powerless against a god!

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:31.650
I set one card and end my turn!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.420
Let's fight, Dragan!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.090
My turn!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:42.740
I activate the Field Spell 
Speed World 2's effect!

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:50.280
By removing 4 Speed Counters, you take 800 
points of damage for each Speed Spell!

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:59.860
Since you can't defeat a god, you've changed 
your strategy to dealing effect damage.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.600
You're wrong!

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:05.420
I always crush my enemy with absolute power!

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:07.880
That's how Jack Atlas duels!

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:10.630
I activate my trap Descending Lost Star.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:15.290
I Special Summon a Synchro Monster 
from my graveyard in defense position.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:19.070
Resurrect, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:29.310
When this effect Special Summons a 
monster, the monster loses its effects...

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:34.750
...loses 1 Level, has 0 defense points 
and can't change battle position!

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:40.190
That's not good enough to 
be a shield against a god!

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:42.410
Who said I was going to use it as a shield?

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:43.310
What?

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:50.600
Look at this wild fighting 
spirit surging through my body!

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:55.110
I've reached a new state 
known as Burning Soul!

00:10:55.510 --> 00:11:03.140
Level 4 Top Runner and Level 1 Barrier 
Resonator double tunes Level 7 Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.040
What?

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.750
Double tuning?

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:19.870
The king and devil now 
merge here!  Rugged soul!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:23.150
Give the roar that created heaven and earth!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.550
Synchro Summon!

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.300
Come, Red Nova Dragon!

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:37.730
Level 12 and 3500 attack points!

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.000
Awesome!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:42.800
All right!  Show him your new power, Jack!

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.800
What's that monster?

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:06.780
It's a battle between god and the devil!

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:09.730
What's that monster?

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:16.210
That monster isn't in our database!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.690
Yusei, is that card...

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:25.960
Yeah.  That's Jack's new ace 
monster Red Nova Dragon.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:31.510
I sense that Red Nova Dragon's 
power rivals that of a god's.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:39.850
Look at that!

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:43.550
Red Nova Dragon and the god are resonating.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:48.570
So that's your new ace monster.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:51.610
Interesting!  I'll fight it!

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:54.090
Bring it, Jack Atlas!

00:12:54.510 --> 00:13:00.640
This card gains 500 attack points for 
every Tuner Monster in my graveyard.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.930
Top Runner and Barrier Resonator 
are in my graveyard.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.400
Therefore, it gains 1000 points!

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.800
4500 attack points!

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.420
He can do it, Yusei!

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:14.400
Yeah!  Thor, Lord of the 
Aesir has 3500 attack points.

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:20.750
If Red Nova Dragon attacks and destroys 
Thor, it will deal 1000 points of damage.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:23.270
Dragan will have 200 life points left.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:30.410
Jack will have 4 Speed Counters on the next 
turn, so if he uses Speed World 2's effect...

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:36.810
He'll deal 800 points of damage irregardless 
of what monster Dragan uses to defend himself.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.500
If this attack succeeds, Jack wins!

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:45.300
Red Nova Dragon attacks 
Thor, Lord of the Aesir!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.050
Burning Soul!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.400
You still don't understand.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:58.140
The three Aesir are god cards that have 
been passed down from ancient times.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:00.850
Everyone is powerless against a god!

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.310
You can't defeat a god!

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:07.060
I activate the trap Raging Sacred Curse!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:11.270
I can only activate this card 
when a god is on my field.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:17.690
One of your monsters loses 2000 
attack points until the End Phase!

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.210
Red Nova Dragon!

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:28.050
Due to Sacred Curse, your spell and 
trap effects can't affect your monster!

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:28.910
What?

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:32.240
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Solemn Authority!

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:38.130
When a god is on the field, 
my god isn't affected

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:42.920
by your trap cards until 
my second Standby Phase!

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.890
As long as the god is on the field,

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:54.750
he can't power up Red Nova Dragon 
with any spell or trap cards!

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:59.200
Furthermore, he can't activate traps 
against Thor, Lord of the Aesir.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:04.180
Jack Atlas, you're caught 
in god's perfect trap!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.380
What?

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:10.800
Thor, Lord of the Aesir 
has 3500 attack points.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:15.410
Red Nova Dragon attacked 
with 2500 attack points.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:19.190
If this battle finishes, Jack 
will take 1000 points of damage

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:23.150
when he only has 900 life 
points left, so he'll lose.

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.110
It's over, Jack!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.280
Thunder Pyle!

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:34.890
For my friends who battle with 
me, I can't afford to lose!

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:39.310
Jack!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:41.970
This is...

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:45.730
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Burning Rebirth!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:49.360
I tribute Red Nova Dragon!

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:56.030
Tribute?

00:15:56.260 --> 00:16:01.810
Due to Burning Rebirth's effect, when a 
Level 8-or-above Synchro Monster is tributed...

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:06.870
I can Special Summon Red Dragon Archfiend 
from my graveyard and equip this card on it.

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:12.340
But if this card leaves the field, 
Red Dragon Archfiend is destroyed!

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:13.750
What's going on?

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:18.570
I thought Red Nova Dragon wasn't 
affected by spells or traps.

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:22.820
Jack didn't use the trap's 
effect on Red Nova Dragon.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:29.170
In order to activate Burning Rebirth, he 
tributed Red Nova Dragon to pay the cost.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:31.490
He escaped by tributing.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.620
Appear, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:52.510
Escaping by tributing was a good idea.

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:56.200
However, Red Dragon Archfiend 
has 3000 attack points.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.770
It can't defeat a god 
with 3500 attack points!

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:01.520
We'll see about that.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:05.620
Burning Rebirth has a second effect.

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:08.850
By sending a Tuner Monster and 
this card to the graveyard,

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:13.710
I can Special Summon the 
tributed Synchro Monster.

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:14.940
What?

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:20.210
Red Dragon Archfiend, Burning 
Rebirth and my hand's Trap Eater

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:23.570
form the foundation for 
summoning Red Nova Dragon!

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.100
Appear, Red Nova Dragon!

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:45.500
Due to Red Nova Dragon's effect, 
it gains 500 attack points

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.810
for every Tuner Monster in my graveyard.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:54.760
The three monsters Trap Eater, Top Runner 
and Barrier Resonator are in my graveyard.

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:59.780
Therefore, Red Nova Dragon 
gains 1500 attack points!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:02.390
5000 attack points?

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:07.460
He removed the god's curse by first sending

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:11.340
Red Nova Dragon to the graveyard 
and then resummoning it.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.490
Who thinks of doing that?

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:19.330
He also instantly surpassed 
Thor's 3500 attack points.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.040
You're incredible, Jack!

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.620
Finish him!

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.340
Here I go, Dragan!

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:27.630
Burning Soul!

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.140
Dragan!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.090
He did it!

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:01.680
Jack won!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:02.850
All right!

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.600
He did it, Yusei!

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.240
Yeah.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.400
Jack!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.150
You're the best, Jack!

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.730
Master Atlas!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.180
He won...

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:21.890
So I'll also get to live.

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:33.670
So this is how King Jack Atlas duels.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:34.900
King?

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:38.910
I don't care about past titles anymore.

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:43.760
The bond with my friends gave me power!

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:44.960
Bond?

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:48.930
And our desire to reach the top!

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:50.380
Friends...

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:58.060
Jack Atlas, I graciously accept defeat.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.040
The shadows in my heart have vanished.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:08.810
However, Team Ragnarok will win this 
match and stop Iliaster's plans!

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:14.020
My life is over, but the duel isn't over yet!

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:18.860
What's this?

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.170
Is it an earthquake?

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:23.360
What's going on?

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:08.660
That's...

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.480
God has resurrected.

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:12.060
What's the meaning of this?

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:14.650
Even if the player dies, god doesn't!

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:21.190
When a god on the field is destroyed and sent to the 
graveyard, it's Special Summoned during the End Phase!

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:22.250
What?

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:29.660
If Red Nova Dragon symbolizes your bond, 
then the three Aesir symbolize our bond!

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:35.820
When this effect Special Summons Thor, Lord 
of the Aesir, you take 800 points of damage!

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:42.990
Jack!

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:56.660
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:57.130 --> 00:22:03.330
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:21.620
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:27.260
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:32.860
You do this over and over

00:22:33.200 --> 00:22:38.570
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:43.980
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:51.480
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:57.220
Close to you   If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.620 --> 00:23:03.060
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:08.500
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:16.610
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
